This repository contains two kinds of third-party material.

Code
----
`third_party/` contains modified copies of model classes from the Open Catalyst
Project library ocpmodels, Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates,
under the MIT License. The full text of that license is third_party/LICENSE.
The LICENSE file at the repository root covers the code written for this
paper and does not replace third_party/LICENSE. The DimeNet++ file also
retains the MIT notice of Matthias Fey. Upstream development of ocpmodels
now continues as FAIR-Chem (https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairchem). The pretrained
checkpoints used to compute the embeddings were released by the Open Catalyst
Project. That distribution is no longer available from the original project
page. One listing that still includes the same checkpoints is mace-ocp
(https://github.com/ACEsuit/mace-ocp).

Data
----
`data/lic/LC_database_rev_with_cif.csv` is derived from the layered-compound
intercalation dataset reported by Kawaguchi et al., deposited at Figshare
(10.6084/m9.figshare.26885734.v1) under CC BY 4.0. Cite:

  Kawaguchi et al., Scientific Data 11, 2024. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-024-04008-2
  Kawaguchi et al., ACS Phys. Chem. Au 2024. https://doi.org/10.1021/acsphyschemau.3c00063

`data/aoi/AoI_with_timestamp.csv` is derived from Materials Project
formation-energy data. Materials Project data are distributed under CC BY 4.0.
The table follows the Alloys of Interest (AoI) benchmark, whose data and code
are deposited at Zenodo (https://zenodo.org/records/7659267). Cite:

  Li et al., npj Computational Materials 9, 2023. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41524-023-01012-9

The `.npy` files under `data/*/embeddings/` are GNN embeddings computed by the
authors from those structures. They are released with this repository under
CC BY 4.0. Please cite the accompanying paper:

  Sugiura and Mizoguchi, Achieving Robust Extrapolation in Materials Property
  Prediction via Decoupled Transfer Learning. PRX Intelligence (2026).
  https://doi.org/10.1103/pbrg-x848
